DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T133000
UID:699de27f1e64afd01e5daff1@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you been wanting to get to know your neighbors better? Ge
 t involved in your community? The Neighborhood Cafe is a monthly all-ages
  program is geared toward building relationships and fostering community
  resilience. It is lightly-structured to encourage conversation. Refreshm
 ents are provided. Every third Saturday of the month in Room 7.
