DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T120000
UID:69e2738a8ddc1caf5f1d8f11@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Music shared with friends is great. Music written for friends 
 is even better! Inspired by Béla Bartók's violin duos\, Greg Ewer commis
 sioned pieces from his longtime friend and collaborator Kenji Bunch. They 
 present some of both composers' works in this program.\nIn partnership wit
 h 45th Parallel Universe.\nHeld at the library hearth.
LOCATION:Tualatin Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e2738a8ddc1caf5f1d8f11
