  instruments\, and tell stories in Mandarin Chinese. No prior Mandarin exp
 erience is needed—just bring your little ones for a joyful\, interactive
  learning experience! Recommended for ages 5 and under with family. Space 
 is limited and available on a first-come\, first-served basis.
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
