DESCRIPTION:The purpose of these 5 series is to help families with childre
 n who may need additional support\, including those with disabilities\, to
  learn tools and strategies to support their successful transition to kind
 ergarten in fall\, 2026. Children and their caregivers will engage in acti
 vities that target academic and social-emotional learning using evidence-b
 ased practices such as predictable routines\, visual support and simple as
 sistive technology. Families will learn how to develop meaningful partners
 hips with their schools to ensure the best start for their learner.\nRegis
