UID:69ceb0b1129f1274383620aa@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Ready\, Set\, Kindergarten is a special 5-class series designe
 d for families. We will help you and your child get ready for Kindergarten
  with music\, stories\, art\, and play! All participants get a free book a
 t each class they attend. Ages 4-5.\nMay 26: Read to Learn\nMay 28: Let's
  Be Friends\nJune 2: Reading & Writing\nJune 4: Let's Talk\nJune 9: Playin
 g Together
