DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260512T180000
UID:69c5cad32866a5b48844ae76@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Love to read? Wish you could talk with other people about book
 s? Join our monthly Teen Book Chat for books\, discussion\, pizza and more
 !\nFor students in grades 9-12.\nRegistration is required\n. A free copy o
 f  June's book selection will be distributed to the first 10 registrants o
 f the program at the May Book Chat! Held in the Community Room.
